{"id":"wb-5-60","name":"丁公遗址","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"丁公遗址","text":"丁公遗址位于中国山东省邹平县长山镇丁公村东，曾被评为1991年度全国十大考古新发现之一，2001年被列为第五批全国重点文物保护单位。\n丁公遗址处于鲁北平原南部的山前平原上，其西0.8公里有孝妇河自南向北流入小清河。1985年至1992年，山东大学历史系对该遗址先后进行了五次发掘。遗址总面积约16万平方米，文化遗存延续时间较长，除少量大汶口文化和岳石文化之外，主要堆积为龙山文化和商周时期的遗存。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E4%B8%81%E5%85%AC%E9%81%97%E5%9D%80","revisionId":90815822,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=90815822","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/b22b127a63b0f14ed9701e65.jpg","title":"20240730 Shandong University Museum - Pottery cup, Dinggong Site.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:20240730_Shandong_University_Museum_-_Pottery_cup,_Dinggong_Site.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/f/f0/20240730_Shandong_University_Museum_-_Pottery_cup%2C_Dinggong_Site.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"Windmemories","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","caption":"​陶杯，丁公遗址出土","width":320,"height":213,"matchEvidence":"对应 Wikidata P373 专属相册：Dinggong Site","categorySourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/Category:Dinggong_Site"}}